{
  "comment": "Calibration fixtures for the claim-confidence rubric in src/megamind/confidence.py. Every case pins the exact score the deterministic rubric must produce; changing a constant in that module must fail this fixture. expected_score null means the confidence stays first-class 'unknown'.",
